  "content": "<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">此模組為下雨天氣時生成水窪，並使暴雪積雪層堆積</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">水窪是新的方塊，您可以手持空瓶子來收集水</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">靈感來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puddles\">Puddles</a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/QHWqXv6/puddle-banner.png\" width=\"768\" height=\"132\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/535D1YoA/images/c0e0dc314c0cea3a4a0d2bfd2a6595cbc05ac60a.png\" width=\"655\" height=\"368\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Motschen/Assets/blob/main/quilt+fabric-banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" height=\"56\" /></p>",
